{"title":"2004 AMC 12B Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems\">2004 AMC 12B #2</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_10B_Problems/Problem_5\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"2004 AMC 10B Problems/Problem 5\">2004 AMC 10B #5</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\">Problem 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>In the expression <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/7/477f10f085ee0f463da5dd2d44b66b2f72a15ace.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c\\cdot a^b-d$\" width=\"69\" height=\"15\" />, the values of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/c/41c544263a265ff15498ee45f7392c5f86c6d151.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/c/d/7cde695f2e4542fd01f860a89189f47a27143b66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, although not necessarily in that order. What is the maximum possible value of the result?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/d/4ed5e1ad462e14dc2557d7dc6ee4be5ab98e2c37.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)\\ }5\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)\\ }6\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)\\ }8\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)\\ }9\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)\\ }10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"351\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/9/c/69cefa6855d2216036df094012f7ad2a7e4e204f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> or <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/8/0/a80d7a3ca845e6cae14b9db710b64331219ec3f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, the expression evaluates to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/4/3/c435877b14645e5045d3dd81fba010195c73d44a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-d&lt;0$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"56\" height=\"13\" />. <br />\nIf <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/4/fc43f0ea59e862d7db01586894e9eea730d427b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />, the expression evaluates to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/b/d8b8a1386c9fcb74bd032b4cc8f1f35578bb5f02.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c-d\\leq 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"72\" height=\"15\" />. <br />\nCase <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/1/791662898215b138613f4dada0a3ce54193d735f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d=0$\" width=\"42\" height=\"12\" /> remains.\nIn that case, we want to maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/1/1c164025588ec9b3df412973bb90660c8e389209.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c\\cdot a^b$\" width=\"36\" height=\"15\" /> where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/6/8/168b479e89f7778932d6890c5577201a8d3a4982.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{a,b,c\\}=\\{1,2,3\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"144\" height=\"18\" />. Trying out the six possibilities we get that the greatest is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/f/b1f3887a8ee7139c71650d413e78bb839c895b71.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b,c)=(3,2,1)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"135\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/b/44bd7126d900fbdd484755ff470e98694fcb4344.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c\\cdot a^b=1\\cdot 3^2=\\boxed{\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"179\" height=\"29\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We first minimize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/a/96ab646de7704969b91c76a214126b45f2b07b25.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$d$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, since is it subtracted and is independent from the rest. Then we are left with <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is from the set <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/d/3fd45d3a1457ea8d4283f1f35415ddbba4a6434c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${1,2,3}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"43\" height=\"16\" />. Then after some logical tries we can get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/b/9/4b9a8869b2515d1f5e7df42eca3ee110ef619f6b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1\\cdot3^2-0=\\boxed{\\mathrm{(D)}\\ 9}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"150\" height=\"32\" /> is the largest.\n</p><p>~TheRealMee\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_1\">Video Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/QtH3vCiqLkU\">https://youtu.be/QtH3vCiqLkU</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"2\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B\">2004 AMC 12B</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Problems\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2004_AMC_12B_Answer_Key\" title=\"2004 AMC 12B Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/community/c13\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"